      "card_ids": ["C17"],
      "claim": "A closely transferable PET probe, [18F]NOS, readily crosses the blood-brain barrier, demonstrating that small heteroaromatic amines can achieve rapid CNS entry.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C01"],
      "claim": "Pyridoxal, a small polar heteroaromatic aldehyde, crosses into human cerebrospinal fluid, supporting CNS access for small heteroaromatic compounds after systemic administration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C11"],
      "claim": "The heteroaromatic PET ligand 11C-AZD2184 crosses the human BBB within 10 minutes after intravenous injection, providing direct evidence that related heteroaromatic structures can achieve meaningful brain exposure.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C16"],
      "claim": "Deferiprone, a small polar iron chelator, enters rat brain rapidly by passive diffusion with unbound brain-to-plasma distribution near 0.9-1.2, showing that polar small molecules can achieve meaningful CNS exposure.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C12"],
      "claim": "A heteroaromatic compound C29 was detected in brain after oral administration, confirming that systemic dosing of a heteroaromatic small molecule can lead to brain penetration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C05"],
      "claim": "Nitrofurantoin, a nitroheterocycle, was present in dog CSF after intravenous infusion, indicating some BBB passage for nitroheteroaromatic compounds, although its CSF/unbound plasma ratio was low (0.06).",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is a small nitroheteroaromatic-thiadiazole compound. All high-transfer experimental analogues, including PET ligands, CSF measurements, brain perfusion, and microdialysis studies, demonstrate BBB permeability and meaningful CNS access for small heteroaromatic and nitroheteroaromatic molecules. The consistent positive evidence outweighs the single weak nitrofurantoin CSF ratio, supporting a pass prediction.",
