    "No direct quantitative brain/plasma or CSF measurement is available for the query molecule itself.",
    "No explicit efflux-transporter data are available for the query, though the positive analogue evidence suggests adequate net CNS access.",
    "The nitrofurantoin record shows only 0.06 CSF/unbound plasma ratio, leaving some uncertainty about the magnitude of CNS exposure for nitroheterocycles."
  ],
  "new_evidence_assessment": [
